Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:01.23,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Pregunta trampa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:02.30,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Tres segundos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.67,0:00:05.37,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Antes de GTA,\Nel estudio que
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.39,0:00:08.34,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}lo creó triunfó\Ncon otro juego.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.30,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿Cuál?\NA, Lemmings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:12.50,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}B, Tetris.\NC, Pac-Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.87,0:00:16.70,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¡La A!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:20.53,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Lemmings, de 1991,\Ncreado por DMA Design,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.55,0:00:24.18,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}el estudio escocés\Nque luego haría GTA.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:26.16,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Tetris nació\Nen la Unión
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.18,0:00:28.14,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Soviética y\NPac-Man, en Japón.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.16,0:00:29.13,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Nada que ver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:30.26,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}¿Acertaste?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:31.67,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}Dímelo en\Ncomentarios y
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.69,0:00:33.49,Marca,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,40)}sígueme para el\Nsiguiente quiz.
